/Subject (Founding AI Product Builder. 9 years full-stack engineering + 6 years production AI. Co-founder CEO/CPO at TNG Shopper \(top-100 retail-tech 2025\); built and led a 7-node multi-agent system serving 11 enterprise customers across 5 countries. $500K raised, $1.53M Contracted ARR. Open-source: Antigravity-OS governance kernel \(PyPI: ag-os\), agent-dag-pipeline, gemma4-vllm-deployment, WP-Multisite, Atelier \(active sprint to Google AI Agents Challenge 2026-06-03\). 5 zero-to-one AI products in 9 years.)
